      "message": "Sorry, missed that last param on first read.\nHow about using an enum so that 0 becomes ENTER_DRP?\nThe \"RC.DRP\u003d1b\" is being set again in tcpci_tcpc_drp_toggle():\n\n\t/* Set auto drp toggle */\n\trv \u003d tcpci_set_role_ctrl(port, 1, TYPEC_RP_USB, TYPEC_CC_RD);\n\nDoes it need to be removed from there if we are now doing it here?",
