      "writtenOn": "2020-03-18T20:54:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually entering DRP is handled at the end of tc_drp_auto_toggle_entry.  This needs to know if we are coming out of being a Source and Sink.  The last parameter is not enter DRP or not enter DRP, it is whether we are connecting or disconnecting.  The parameter name is \"connect\".  I could create an enum if you think that would help.",
      "parentUuid": "ce36b0dc_723df411",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1704,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1704,
        "endChar": 21
