      "writtenOn": "2020-03-18T21:07:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the enum, what about 0\u003dSET_DRP and 1\u003dCLEAR_DRP, since that matches \"Set RC.DRP\u003d1b\" and \"Set RC.DRP\u003d0\"\n\nFor tcpci_tcpc_drp_toggle() calling tcpci_set_role_ctrl() I guess there should be no harm setting it to the same value a second time, but we will be changing from TYPEC_CC_RP to TYPEC_CC_RD in the SRC-\u003eDRP case (below).",
      "parentUuid": "13843401_42f6f50b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1704,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1704,
        "endChar": 21
